        "questionNum": "195",
        "passageTitle": "Questions 191=195 refer to the following e-mail, product information, and invoice.",
        "passageText": "From: a martin @ net force events.com\nTo: mpresser@gerenukofficedesign.com Date: September 3\nSubject: Chairs (Item #10405)\nDear Mr. Presser,\nAs a result of our company's expansion last spring, we moved into a larger facility and\nneeded new furniture. At that time we ordered 22 office chairs from Gerenuk Office Design\n(Item #10405-Blue). Within two months, many of the chairs were broken and unusable.\nWe were initially happy with the replacement chairs that you delivered free of charge, but\nsome of those have now broken as well.\nI am here by requesting that you replace all 22 with chairs from your new Executive line\n(Item #10612) at no extra charge ------- assuming that they are better quality. These are\ncomparable in price to the original model we purchased. If you are unable to do this, we\nwill be forced to look elsewhere for our furnishing needs.\nAlexandra Martin, Office Administrator\nNetforce Events\n(http://www.hansons-office.com/ergonomic-task-chair A\nHANSON S: YOUR ONE-STOP SHOP FOR OFFICE SUPPLIES\nHome Products I f Customer f About Us\nHelp^\nErgonomic Task Chair\nThe Ergonomic Task Chair is our best-selling swivel • Black, Item Code 429BL\nmodel. It is specially designed to promote good posture • Blue, Item Code 469BB\nand avoid discomfort, and therefore it is perfect for those •Green, Item Code 490GN\nlong workdays at the office. Best of all, it is built to last •Red, Item Code 459RD\nand comes with a lifetime warranty. The model is available\nin four attractive colors.\n$159 per unit\n194\n\nHANSON S: YOUR ONE-STOP SHOP FOR OFFICE SUPPLIES\nINVOICE\nClient: Netforce Events\nAddress: 342 Collat'd Boulevard, Hampton, ME\nDate: September 10\nItem Quantity Unit Price Total\nErgonomic Task Chair, 22 $159.00 $3,498.00\nItem 490GN\nSubtotal $3,498.00\nDiscount for first-time customers -$159.00\nTotal $3,339.00\nPlease contact customerhelp@hansons-office.com if you have any questions.",
